### Analytics Service API Tests

@Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@Analytics_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@token = your_jwt_token_here

### Get Dashboard Data (via Gateway)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Dashboard Data with Date Range (via Gateway)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/dashboard?startDate=2025-10-01&endDate=2025-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Revenue Report (via Gateway)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/revenue?startDate=2025-10-01&endDate=2025-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Revenue Report - Last 7 Days (via Gateway)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/revenue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Product Performance - Top 10 (via Gateway)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/products?top=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Product Performance - Top 5 (via Gateway)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/products?top=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Record Analytics Event (via Gateway)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "OrderCreated",
  "entityType": "Order",
  "entityId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "data": "{\"totalAmount\": 125.99, \"itemsCount\": 3}",
  "userId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
}

### Record Product Viewed Event (via Gateway)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "ProductViewed",
  "entityType": "Product",
  "entityId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "userId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
}

### Record Order Completed Event (via Gateway)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "OrderCompleted",
  "entityType": "Order",
  "entityId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "data": "{\"completedAt\": \"2025-11-01T10:30:00Z\"}",
  "userId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
}

###############################################
# Direct Service Tests (without Gateway)
###############################################

### Get Dashboard Data (Direct)
GET {{Analytics_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Revenue Report (Direct)
GET {{Analytics_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/revenue?startDate=2025-10-01&endDate=2025-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Product Performance (Direct)
GET {{Analytics_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/products?top=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

